  "draft_py": "# {3}{W}: Put a +1/+1 counter on another target attacking creature you control. If that creature is\n# a Cat, it gains first strike until end of turn.\n# The Conditional judges the object the counter went on (the result register,\n# executor._conditional_subject); the grant goes to the same target (Sure Strike's shared selector).\nT = Selector(\n    count=QConst(value=1), mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n    filter=FAnd(children=(\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_ATTACKING),\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n        FNot(inner=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE)),\n    )),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),))\ntrain = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostManaColor(color='W', amount=QConst(value=1)), CostManaGeneric(amount=QConst(value=3)))),\n    effect=Seq(steps=(\n        A(Verb.PUT_COUNTER, {\n            'count': QConst(value=1),\n            'counter_kind': CounterKind.PLUS_1_PLUS_1,\n            'target': T,\n        }),\n        Conditional(\n            pred=FAnd(children=(\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.SUBTYPE_EQ, string_value='Cat'),\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n            )),\n            then_effect=A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.FIRST_STRIKE),\n                'duration': DurationEot(),\n                'target': T,\n            }),\n        ),\n    )),\n)\nabilities = [train, *compiled]\n",
